Mistakes Beginners Should Avoid
•	Publishing Unedited AI Content: Unverified output can sound repetitive and introduce factual errors.
•	Focusing Solely on Tools: Platforms change rapidly, but fundamental marketing principles remain constant.
•	Neglecting Analytics: Without tracking key metrics, evaluating campaign success is impossible.
•	Overlooking Local Optimization: Local listings (such as Google Business Profiles) are critical for attracting regional customers in Pune.
•	Selecting Courses Based Only on Cost: Low-cost programs without practical project experience rarely yield career growth.
